# text = The canisters were almost out of her reach ; I made a motion to aid her ; she turned upon me as a miser might turn if any one attempted to assist him in counting his gold she snapped I hastened to reply she demanded , tying an apron over her neat black frock , and standing with a spoonful of the leaf poised over the pot I answered she repeated I said , half smiling She flung the tea back , spoon and all , and resumed her chair in a pet ; her forehead corrugated , and her red under-lip pushed out , like a child's ready to cry .
