# text = I was condemned to hear all out : finally , he reached the At that crisis , a sudden inspiration descended on me ; I was moved to rise and denounce Jabez Branderham as the sinner of the sin that no Christian need pardon I exclaimed cried Jabez , after a solemn pause , leaning over his cushion With that concluding word , the whole assembly , exalting their pilgrim's staves , rushed round me in a body ; and I , having no weapon to raise in self-defence , commenced grappling with Joseph , my nearest and most ferocious assailant , for his .
