# text = I bid them be quiet , now that they saw me returned , and , benumbed to my very heart , I dragged up-stairs ; whence , after putting on dry clothes , and pacing to and fro thirty or forty minutes , to restore the animal heat , I adjourned to my study , feeble as a kitten : almost too much so to enjoy the cheerful fire and smoking coffee which the servant had prepared for my refreshment WHAT vain weathercocks we are !
