# text = Before I came to live here , she commenced - waiting no farther invitation to her story - I was almost always at Wuthering Heights ; because my mother had nursed Mr . Hindley Earnshaw , that was Hareton's father , and I got used to playing with the children : I ran errands too , and helped to make hay , and hung about the farm ready for anything that anybody would set me to .
