# text = Heathcliff took the handsomest , but it soon fell lame , and when he discovered it , he said to Hindley Hindley put out his tongue , and cuffed him over the ears he persisted , escaping to the porch ( they were in the stable cried Hindley , threatening him with an iron weight used for weighing potatoes and hay he replied , standing still Hindley threw it , hitting him on the breast , and down he fell , but staggered up immediately , breathless and white ; and , had not I prevented it , he would have gone just so to the master , and got full revenge by letting his condition plead for him , intimating who had caused it said young Earnshaw Heathcliff had gone to loose the beast , and shift it to his own stall ; he was passing behind it , when Hindley finished his speech by knocking him under its feet , and without stopping to examine whether his hopes were fulfilled , ran away as fast as he could .
