# text = His peevish reproofs wakened in her a naughty delight to provoke him : she was never so happy as when we were all scolding her at once , and she defying us with her bold , saucy look , and her ready words ; turning Joseph's religious curses into ridicule , baiting me , and doing just what her father hated most - showing how her pretended insolence , which he thought real , had more power over Heathcliff than his kindness : how the boy would do HER bidding in anything , and HIS only when it suited his own inclination .
