# text = The curate might set as many chapters as he pleased for Catherine to get by heart , and Joseph might thrash Heathcliff till his arm ached ; they forgot everything the minute they were together again : at least the minute they had contrived some naughty plan of revenge ; and many a time I've cried to myself to watch them growing more reckless daily , and I not daring to speak a syllable , for fear of losing the small power I still retained over the unfriended creatures .
