# text = He might well skulk behind the settle , on beholding such a bright , graceful damsel enter the house , instead of a rough-headed counterpart of himself , as he expected she demanded , pulling off her gloves , and displaying fingers wonderfully whitened with doing nothing and staying indoors cried Mr . Hindley , enjoying his discomfiture , and gratified to see what a forbidding young blackguard he would be compelled to present himself Cathy , catching a glimpse of her friend in his concealment , flew to embrace him ; she bestowed seven or eight kisses on his cheek within the second , and then stopped , and drawing back , burst into a laugh , exclaiming She had some reason to put the question , for shame and pride threw double gloom over his countenance , and kept him immovable said Mr . Earnshaw , condescendingly replied the boy , finding his tongue at last
