# text = The poor thing couldn't bear that ; she grew white and red in rapid succession , and , while tears beaded her lashes , bent the strength of her small fingers to loosen the firm clutch of Catherine ; and perceiving that as fast as she raised one finger off her arm another closed down , and she could not remove the whole together , she began to make use of her nails ; and their sharpness presently ornamented the detainer's with crescents of red exclaimed Mrs .
