# text = Then , the paleness of her face - its haggard aspect having vanished as she recovered flesh - and the peculiar expression arising from her mental state , though painfully suggestive of their causes , added to the touching interest which she awakened ; and - invariably to me , I know , and to any person who saw her , I should think - refuted more tangible proofs of convalescence , and stamped her as one doomed to decay .
