# text = Since early morning she had been busy ordering her own small affairs ; and now attired in her new black frock - poor thing ! her aunt's death impressed her with no definite sorrow - she obliged me , by constant worrying , to walk with her down through the grounds to meet them she chattered , as we strolled leisurely over the swells and hollows of mossy turf , under shadow of the trees She ran , and returned and ran again , many times before my sober footsteps reached the gate , and then she seated herself on the grassy bank beside the path , and tried to wait patiently ; but that was impossible : she couldn't be still a minute she exclaimed I refused staunchly .
