# text = And , aiding the indignant elder with a lift by the arm , he rid the room of him and closed the door shouted Joseph , as he slowly drew off TO obviate the danger of this threat being fulfilled , Mr . Linton commissioned me to take the boy home early , on Catherine's pony ; and , said he Linton was very reluctant to be roused from his bed at five o'clock , and astonished to be informed that he must prepare for further travelling ; but I softened off the matter by stating that he was going to spend some time with his father , Mr . Heathcliff , who wished to see him so much , he did not like to defer the pleasure till he should recover from his late journey he cried , in strange perplexity I replied asked Linton I answered persevered the child I said he demanded replied I he continued I said .
