# text = This twentieth of March was a beautiful spring day , and when her father had retired , my young lady came down dressed for going out , and said she asked to have a ramble on the edge of the moor with me : Mr . Linton had given her leave , if we went only a short distance and were back within the hour she cried I answered she said I put on my bonnet and sallied out , thinking nothing more of the matter .
