# text = She bounded before me , and returned to my side , and was off again like a young greyhound ; and , at first , I found plenty of entertainment in listening to the larks singing far and near , and enjoying the sweet , warm sunshine ; and watching her , my pet and my delight , with her golden ringlets flying loose behind , and her bright cheek , as soft and pure in its bloom as a wild rose , and her eyes radiant with cloudless pleasure .
