# text = Heathcliff having overheard the conversation , as well as I , smiled when he saw him go ; but immediately afterwards cast a look of singular aversion on the flippant pair , who remained chattering in the door-way : the boy finding animation enough while discussing Hareton's faults and deficiencies , and relating anecdotes of his goings on ; and the girl relishing his pert and spiteful sayings , without considering the ill-nature they evinced .
