# text = In summer Miss Catherine delighted to climb along these trunks , and sit in the branches , swinging twenty feet above the ground ; and I , pleased with her agility and her light , childish heart , still considered it proper to scold every time I caught her at such an elevation , but so that she knew there was no necessity for descending .
