# text = The invalid complained of being covered with ashes ; but he had a tiresome cough , and looked feverish and ill , so I did not rebuke his temper murmured Catherine , when his corrugated brow relaxed he asked I had received no thanks for my other service ; and being unwilling to run to and fro at his behest , I replied he exclaimed fretfully , turning away I asked , perceiving Catherine to be checked in her friendly advances he cried Cathy began searching for some water ; she lighted on a pitcher in the dresser , filled a tumbler , and brought it .
