# text = Then he walked so feebly , and looked so pale , that I immediately exclaimed Catherine surveyed him with grief and astonishment : she changed the ejaculation of joy on her lips to one of alarm ; and the congratulation on their long-postponed meeting to an anxious inquiry , whether he were worse than usual he panted , trembling , and retaining her hand as if he needed its support , while his large blue eyes wandered timidly over her ; the hollowness round them transforming to haggard wildness the languid expression they once possessed persisted his cousin ; ' worse than when I saw you last ; you are thinner , and he interrupted , hurriedly Badly satisfied , Cathy sat down , and he reclined beside her said she , making an effort at cheerfulness Linton did not appear to remember what she talked of and he had evidently great difficulty in sustaining any kind of conversation .
